{"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"],"generated":true,"title":"Essentials"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Add an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Getting Started with Ada Script"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"AdaEngine provides two ways to install Ada Script plugins:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Automatic discovery","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" embeds every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file in an executable target at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build time and generates one plugin backed by one target-level script module."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Manual loading","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" creates an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" from source text or a file URL at runtime."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEditor-created projects use automatic discovery. Use manual loading when scripts live outside the Swift target, come from a downloaded package, or need explicit error handling."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Create a script","anchor":"Create-a-script"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Movement.ada"},{"type":"text","text":" anywhere below the executable target’s source directory, for example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Sources\/MyGame\/","├── main.swift","└── Scripts\/","    └── Movement.ada"],"syntax":"text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare a system and its query with annotations:"}]},{"syntax":"ada","type":"codeListing","code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class MovementSystem {","    @query(Transform)","    var transforms;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var entity in transforms) {","            var position = entity.transform.position;","            position[0] += 100 * context.deltaTime;","            entity.transform.position = position;","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEngine discovers "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@system"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@query"},{"type":"text","text":" metadata and calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update(context)"},{"type":"text","text":" whenever the selected scheduler runs."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Enable automatic discovery","type":"heading","anchor":"Enable-automatic-discovery"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Expose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptBuildPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" to your executable target in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ swift-tools-version: 6.2","import PackageDescription","","let package = Package(","    name: \"MyGame\",","    platforms: [","        .macOS(.v15)","    ],","    dependencies: [","        .package(","            url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/AdaEngine\/AdaEngine.git\",","            branch: \"main\"","        )","    ],","    targets: [","        .executableTarget(","            name: \"MyGame\",","            dependencies: [","                .product(name: \"AdaEngine\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ],","            plugins: [","                .plugin(name: \"AdaScriptBuildPlugin\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ]","        )","    ]",")"]},{"style":"important","type":"aside","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Choose a version requirement appropriate for your project instead of a branch dependency when consuming a released AdaEngine version.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The build plugin finds ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" files through SwiftPM, sorts them by target-relative","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path, and generates ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdaScriptPluginsGenerated.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the plugin work","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directory. The generated plugin passes one source map to one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","type":"reference"},{"text":". Script source is embedded in the executable; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"original files are not read at runtime.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Install the generated plugin in your app scene:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import AdaEngine","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(AdaScriptPluginsGenerated())","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rebuilding the target after adding, removing, renaming, or editing an "},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file refreshes the generated source."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a portable AdaScript project running in AdaEditor’s macOS game window, edits"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" files hot reload after a short pause, including unsaved editor buffers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The current ECS world remains active. A failed candidate leaves the last valid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code running and reports the error in Output. System instances and ordinary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"script globals restart, and startup systems run once for the new version;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exported scriptable-object fields survive. Changes to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component, resource, network, or scriptable-object schemas require restarting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the game."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The same generated source contains native backing structs and registration for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scalar "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@component"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@resource"},{"type":"text","text":" declarations. Because these declarations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change Swift layout, adding or editing their stored fields requires rebuilding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the target rather than source-only reload."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Register-custom-components","level":2,"text":"Register custom components"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ada Script resolves component names while plugins are set up. Register custom Swift components before the generated script plugin:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import AdaEngine","","@Component","struct Movement: Codable, Sendable {","    var velocity: Vector2","}","","struct GameComponentsPlugin: Plugin {","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        Movement.registerComponent()","    }","}","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(","            GameComponentsPlugin(),","            AdaScriptPluginsGenerated()","        )","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" macro supplies field reflection for supported property types. A plain "},{"code":"Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can participate in query matching, but its fields are not automatically available through the script bridge."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Load-a-script-manually","level":2,"text":"Load a script manually"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin"},{"text":" when you need control over the source location or loading failure:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import AdaEngine","","struct RuntimeScriptsPlugin: Plugin {","    let scriptURL: URL","","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        do {","            let script = try AdaScriptPlugin(contentsOf: scriptURL)","            app.addPlugin(script)","        } catch {","            print(\"Could not load Ada Script: \\(error)\")","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when one source is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already in memory, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptPlugin\/init(sources:name:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values for a multi-file module. Script compilation,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"import resolution, and annotation validation happen during initialization."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Native component resolution happens later during plugin setup."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Next-steps","level":2,"text":"Next steps"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Read ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage"},{"type":"text","text":" for annotation syntax, then "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for queries, component fields, and native iterator behavior."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/GettingStartedWithAdaScript":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Add an ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","title":"Getting Started with Ada Script","role":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptSource":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptsource","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdaScriptSource","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AdaScriptSource","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One source file embedded in an Ada Script module."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AdaScriptSource"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptLanguage":{"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptlanguage","kind":"article","title":"Ada Script Language","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Use Ada Script syntax with AdaEngine declaration annotations. New to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language? Start with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics"},{"type":"text","text":" for values, functions, types,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties, control flow, asynchronous work, and annotations."}],"role":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptPlugin":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AdaScriptPlugin"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptplugin","title":"AdaScriptPlugin","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Loads an annotation-driven Ada Script module."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AdaScriptPlugin"}]},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting":{"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting","kind":"symbol","title":"Ada Script","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Write gameplay systems in Ada Script while keeping entity filtering and access planning in AdaEngine’s native ECS."}],"role":"collection"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptECS":{"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptecs","kind":"article","title":"Ada Script ECS","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Declare annotation-driven systems and iterate native AdaECS component columns.","type":"text"}],"role":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptPlugin/init(source:name:)":{"title":"init(source:name:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"convenience","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"source"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"name"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptplugin\/init(source:name:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptBasics":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptbasics","title":"Ada Script Basics","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn the syntax of Ada Script before connecting a script to a scene or ECS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world. Ada Script files use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" extension. The examples on this page are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"small pieces you can combine in one file; a game does not need a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"main()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"function. Start with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","isActive":true},{"text":" to run a complete system.","type":"text"}],"role":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptLibraries":{"title":"AdaScript Libraries","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Share reusable AdaScript functions, systems, and scriptable objects through a GitHub repository.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"AdaEditor installs the library and its transitive dependencies into the project. Run, Play Mode,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Preview, and "},{"code":"AdaScriptBuildPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" load the same installed sources without network access."}],"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptlibraries","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptAnnotations":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptannotations","title":"Ada Script Annotation Reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose an annotation by the declaration it describes. Annotation arguments"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are literals, identifiers, or lists of those values, not runtime expressions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The same spelling can have different roles: "},{"code":"@component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" declares a struct,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while "},{"code":"@component(required: true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" binds an existing component to a scriptable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance."}],"kind":"article","role":"article"}}}